    "status": "implemented",
    "tier": "T1",
    "support": "partial",
    "support_note": "modes TRANSLATION, ROTATION, RESIZE (every mode with a transform handler) and TOSPHERE, SHRINKFATTEN, PUSHPULL, CREASE, VERTEX_CREASE, BWEIGHT, MIRROR, EDGESLIDE (Edit Mode on meshes; in Object Mode SHRINKFATTEN and EDGESLIDE raise Blender's RuntimeError and VERTEX_CREASE does nothing); the other modes are not implemented; snapping options change nothing",
    "headless": "native",
    "planned": "M2",
    "extension": false,
    "notes": [
      "value is an array: setting it constrains to every axis (mode='ROTATION' with a value scales positions by cos(angle), as in Blender)."
    ]
  }
